{"yacht":[{"c":"Our yacht club has ten members.","cn":"我们的游艇俱乐部里有十个会员。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #23451 (CK) & #4262253 (notabene)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/23451"},{"c":"The yacht sailed around a buoy.","cn":"游艇绕浮标航行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #29895 (CM) & #9974952 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/29895"}],"yard":[{"c":"I planted a peach tree in my yard.","cn":"我在我的院子里种了棵桃树。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2772380 (CK) & #5983603 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2772380"},{"c":"My house has a small yard.","cn":"我的房子有一個小院子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #250559 (CK) & #862885 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/250559"}],"yawn":[{"c":"We yawn when we are short of oxygen.","cn":"我们缺氧时就会打哈欠。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #22954 (CK) & #10460425 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/22954"},{"c":"Cover your mouth when you cough, sneeze, or yawn.","cn":"你咳嗽、打喷嚏或打哈欠的时候要捂住你的嘴。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #21841 (CK) & #401028 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/21841"}],"year":[{"c":"He works hard all the year round.","cn":"他一年到頭努力工作。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #288455 (CK) & #888497 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/288455"},{"c":"Hope to see you again next year.","cn":"希望明年再次見到你。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #322505 (CK) & #769683 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/322505"}],"yell":[{"c":"I didn't mean to yell.","cn":"我沒想叫的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2275892 (CK) & #13137889 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2275892"},{"c":"Don't yell at me.","cn":"別對著我吼。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #250169 (CK) & #1422756 (cienias)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/250169"}],"yellow":[{"c":"Apples are usually green, yellow, or red.","cn":"蘋果通常是綠色、黃色或紅色。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2976130 (patgfisher) & #13539405 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2976130"},{"c":"The door of the office is yellow.","cn":"办公室的门是黄色的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #397029 (CM) & #397033 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/397029"}],"yen":[{"c":"I gave them one thousand yen each.","cn":"我給了他們每個人一千日元。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #252453 (CK) & #879163 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/252453"},{"c":"I'd like to change yen to dollars.","cn":"我想把日元換成美元。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #60231 (CK) & #891165 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/60231"}],"yes":[{"c":"He told me when to say yes.","cn":"他告诉我什么时候该说是。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289019 (CK) & #333538 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289019"},{"c":"Yes, I did mean to say that.","cn":"對，我就是想那麼說。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8999497 (CK) & #13137935 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8999497"}],"yesterday":[{"c":"A burglar broke into the shop yesterday.","cn":"昨天强盗闯进了店里。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #244581 (CK) & #2032254 (ydcok)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/244581"},{"c":"Did you have a good time yesterday?","cn":"你昨天玩得開心嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #244507 (CK) & #833200 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/244507"}],"yet":[{"c":"Have you bought a raffle ticket yet?","cn":"你买彩票了吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #640834 (darinmex) & #812267 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/640834"},{"c":"Have you finished doing your homework yet?","cn":"你做完回家作業了嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #16399 (CK) & #775784 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/16399"}],"yield":[{"c":"You must not yield to temptation.","cn":"你不應該屈服在誘惑之下。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #324512 (CK) & #1228964 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/324512"},{"c":"They obtained a yield of 8 percent on their investment.","cn":"他們在這次的投資中得到百分之八的收益。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #307232 (CM) & #1225662 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/307232"}],"you":[{"c":"All of us like you very much.","cn":"我们都非常喜欢你。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #248305 (CM) & #510780 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/248305"},{"c":"All three of you are very lucky.","cn":"你們三個很走運。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3749297 (CK) & #6159156 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3749297"}],"young":[{"c":"A group of young men were fighting.","cn":"一群年輕人在打架。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #265803 (CK) & #864462 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/265803"},{"c":"Dozens of young people attended the demonstration.","cn":"几十个年轻人参加了示威游行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #24539 (CK) & #335242 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/24539"}],"your":[{"c":"Are you still living with your parents?","cn":"你依然和父母住一起吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3177274 (Hybrid) & #5091274 (mirrorvan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3177274"},{"c":"At what time does your class end?","cn":"您几点下课？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1892006 (CK) & #410476 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1892006"}],"yours":[{"c":"Compared to yours, my car is small.","cn":"和你的车比起来，我的车很小。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #336063 (killer4o) & #332575 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/336063"},{"c":"Compared with yours, my car is small.","cn":"和你的车比起来，我的车很小。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #17084 (papabear) & #332575 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/17084"}],"yourself":[{"c":"Can you make yourself understood in French?","cn":"別人聽得懂你說的法語嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #69776 (CK) & #811820 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/69776"},{"c":"Can you move this desk by yourself?","cn":"你能自己搬這張桌子嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #27659 (CK) & #864450 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/27659"}],"youth":[{"c":"Is there a youth hostel around here?","cn":"附近有没有青年旅舍？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #568302 (CK) & #394981 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/568302"},{"c":"Is there a youth hostel near here?","cn":"附近有没有青年旅舍？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1662 (confusion) & #394981 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1662"}]}
